WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:11.640
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.980 --> 00:24.460
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.560 --> 00:31.560
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.390 --> 00:39.760
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.070
If my wish comes true...

00:43.070 --> 00:49.820
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.820 --> 00:56.540
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.540 --> 01:06.050
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.080
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.370 --> 01:23.760
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:31.730 --> 01:35.030
The Knights' Goal

01:35.340 --> 01:37.530
Glow Lash!

01:58.590 --> 01:59.840
The room...

02:05.750 --> 02:09.600
He keeps dodging my attacks...

02:09.980 --> 02:11.260
What's with that guy?

02:11.260 --> 02:12.870
He's annoying.

02:12.870 --> 02:15.060
But his skill is incredible.

02:16.130 --> 02:17.360
You're great!

02:22.810 --> 02:26.660
But, like I said, your sword can't cut me.

02:27.350 --> 02:30.170
There's nothing my sword can't cut.

02:31.980 --> 02:33.670
Your eyes are beautiful.

02:34.460 --> 02:36.920
They're just like the emerald color of the sea.

02:37.180 --> 02:39.180
H-How rude!

02:46.220 --> 02:50.770
When fighting, you need to be mindful not only of your opponent, but also of your surroundings.

02:52.370 --> 02:55.220
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

02:57.210 --> 02:57.820
Oops!

02:58.630 --> 03:00.820
Are you serious?

03:01.250 --> 03:03.140
I'm always serious!

03:06.020 --> 03:07.120
That's enough!

03:07.520 --> 03:09.590
It's obvious who the winner is.

03:09.590 --> 03:13.630
As a knight, you must be chivalrous, Priecia.

03:14.560 --> 03:15.380
But...

03:20.740 --> 03:22.680
Marquis...

03:23.890 --> 03:24.930
Now, then.

03:25.480 --> 03:27.930
Thank you for helping me out.

03:28.530 --> 03:30.430
I have a favor to ask of you.

03:30.620 --> 03:33.390
You've just made a successful debut.

03:33.390 --> 03:36.730
So what do you say to making an oath
on behalf of the new students?

03:37.700 --> 03:38.480
Debut?

03:39.490 --> 03:43.890
A knight will adapt and win, even unexpected fights.

03:43.890 --> 03:49.760
So which student would be more suited to take the oath than you, who just proved your worth?

03:49.760 --> 03:51.250
No, nobody could be.

03:51.250 --> 03:52.500
Full stop.

03:53.740 --> 03:56.750
No, what's this "oath"?

03:57.070 --> 03:58.250
That's a good question.

03:58.550 --> 04:03.510
Taking the oath declares your determination to become a knight.

04:03.730 --> 04:09.010
By taking it, you also swear that you will aim to become a knight, no matter what.

04:09.010 --> 04:11.770
There is no greater honor for new students.

04:12.170 --> 04:13.570
Will you take on the role?

04:13.570 --> 04:15.060
Um, I...

04:16.540 --> 04:19.360
All current and new students...

04:19.360 --> 04:22.860
He will now take the oath as a representative of the new students!

04:23.310 --> 04:25.080
Okay, Hyaweh.

04:25.080 --> 04:26.240
Take the oath!

04:30.220 --> 04:33.370
Nice! Go for it!

04:33.760 --> 04:35.700
He's our representative?!

04:35.700 --> 04:37.880
I can't accept that!

04:38.210 --> 04:40.530
But he's sort of cool.

04:42.700 --> 04:45.550
Putting that aside, I feel sorry for Priecia.

04:45.550 --> 04:48.390
It was unfair to make her stumble over those Mokujin.

04:48.620 --> 04:50.180
You two think too much.

04:51.170 --> 04:54.390
I mean, it was only a fluke... a fluke.

04:54.730 --> 04:57.640
No. Those must've been his tactics.

04:57.640 --> 04:59.650
He was trying to make it impossible for her to fight.

04:59.830 --> 05:01.820
Is that even possible?!

05:01.820 --> 05:05.110
Way to go, Hero! Give it your all and take the oath!

05:13.090 --> 05:15.570
Now swear your oath as you would like.

05:15.570 --> 05:17.710
Well, uh...

05:19.590 --> 05:20.520
What's this?

05:20.520 --> 05:23.000
Declare the oath into this Prism.

05:23.000 --> 05:24.600
In a loud voice, okay?

05:24.600 --> 05:26.220
What should I say to them?

05:26.780 --> 05:28.900
You can say whatever you want.

05:28.900 --> 05:33.120
Any wholehearted speech is sure to impress.

05:33.120 --> 05:34.230
Fear not.

05:34.530 --> 05:37.320
Any other advice would be good... maybe something useful.

05:37.320 --> 05:38.500
I wish you the best of luck.

05:38.500 --> 05:40.010
H-Hey, just a moment!

05:49.260 --> 05:51.280
Ouch...

06:00.190 --> 06:01.710
Nice job!

06:03.460 --> 06:04.710
I'm sorry.

06:06.250 --> 06:07.210
How dare you...

06:07.210 --> 06:12.890
Don't you know that I, Mibu Karin, belong to the Tempelritter and am the combat instructor for the Pegasus class?!

06:12.890 --> 06:15.970
No, well... I didn't mean to.

06:17.120 --> 06:18.500
Unforgivable!

06:20.160 --> 06:23.480
I shall make you yet another victim of my sword, Kiku-Ichimonji.

06:27.970 --> 06:30.280
Wait, wait!

06:32.830 --> 06:34.070
Quit running, coward!

06:34.070 --> 06:35.950
Who wouldn't run?

06:37.150 --> 06:40.810
Hey, would you please listen to me for a moment?

06:40.810 --> 06:42.040
No more excuses!

06:44.290 --> 06:48.540
I have something to tell you... for your benefit.

06:49.950 --> 06:51.050
No need for arguments.

06:51.870 --> 06:53.050
Prepare yourself!

06:53.880 --> 06:56.310
School is a scary place...

06:56.680 --> 06:58.830
So, those are your last words?

06:58.830 --> 07:00.090
They're not!

07:03.780 --> 07:05.360
It's a miracle you're still alive.

07:05.690 --> 07:08.360
That's bad, you know... You should put something on.

07:08.490 --> 07:09.630
What do you mean?

07:14.790 --> 07:18.710
Well, I'm the one who's embarrassed looking at it.

07:19.560 --> 07:21.670
Oh, you don't have to thank me.

07:21.670 --> 07:24.500
This is what a knight ought to do.

07:26.050 --> 07:28.380
How dare you...

07:28.550 --> 07:29.880
N-No good!

07:30.400 --> 07:31.800
I won't forgive you!

07:32.820 --> 07:35.240
Mibu style, hidden sword technique!

07:35.240 --> 07:37.750
Souryuuzan!

07:35.240 --> 07:37.750
Twin Dragon Slash

07:48.740 --> 07:53.420
That elegance, dignity, and arrogant attitude...

07:53.420 --> 07:56.260
I couldn't help referring to her as royalty...

07:56.260 --> 07:59.910
She must be the princess. Must be.

08:03.310 --> 08:06.920
But the princess is said to be the most skillful sword user in the kingdom.

08:14.500 --> 08:17.140
I have some doubt about it. Some doubt.

08:17.140 --> 08:19.740
Somehow I'm getting confused...

08:19.740 --> 08:22.060
Oh Aruke, grant me the truth.

08:22.430 --> 08:25.440
What, what, what? What's the truth?

08:24.640 --> 08:28.650
It's possible that Priecia lost to him on purpose.

08:28.650 --> 08:30.570
Why, why, why?

08:30.570 --> 08:33.480
To hide her identity of course. Hide her identity.

08:33.480 --> 08:35.090
But why, why, why?

08:35.090 --> 08:36.720
Hey, Bridget?

08:36.720 --> 08:37.890
That's because...

08:40.450 --> 08:41.580
When did you get here?!

08:42.870 --> 08:44.020
It hurts...

08:44.020 --> 08:48.090
You're the troublemaker that mistook me for Priecia.

08:49.530 --> 08:51.510
Sorry for earlier.

08:51.510 --> 08:54.660
People tend to believe that I'm a reliable person,

08:54.660 --> 08:56.840
but I'm actually more careless than I look.

08:59.430 --> 09:03.570
So, why are you following me?

09:03.570 --> 09:07.570
Do you have a grudge against me or something? A grudge?

09:07.570 --> 09:09.860
What are you saying, Bridget?

09:09.860 --> 09:12.770
We're roommates, you know.

09:17.510 --> 09:19.660
You're... Fel?

09:20.310 --> 09:23.910
A lot has happened, but nice to meet you, Bridget.

09:24.400 --> 09:26.420
Nice to meet you, too. Meet you.

09:26.700 --> 09:29.260
<i>It seems she didn't hear me talking to myself.</i>

09:29.260 --> 09:30.710
<i>Oh, thank Aruke.</i>

09:30.960 --> 09:34.720
Anyway, I didn't know you were also interested in Priecia.

09:35.930 --> 09:38.060
<i>She did hear me after all.</i>

09:38.060 --> 09:40.430
<i>Not good. This is not good.</i>

09:40.710 --> 09:44.230
But it's understandable, since she's very admirable.

09:44.230 --> 09:47.660
Did you know she lives in a real castle?

09:47.660 --> 09:50.010
She is definitely the princess.

09:50.640 --> 09:53.230
A person of royalty is our classmate, huh...

09:53.230 --> 09:56.200
Also, I heard the instructor, Karin,
is a member of the Tempelritter.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.740
This academy is awesome, isn't it?

09:58.120 --> 09:59.490
Tempel... ritter...?

09:59.770 --> 10:00.990
You don't know?

10:01.380 --> 10:04.470
You're innocent in the ways of the world, aren't you, Bridget?

10:04.470 --> 10:05.500
Yeah.

10:06.020 --> 10:09.790
The Tempelritter is a group of the strongest knights in Viella.

10:09.790 --> 10:15.120
Each member is a master who can easily
fight a dozen foes on their own.

10:15.120 --> 10:18.070
Instructor Karin is here to teach us sword fighting,

10:18.070 --> 10:21.380
but her training is so intense that her students always get injured.

10:21.380 --> 10:24.810
Ah, I'm feeling like this school is above me.

10:24.810 --> 10:27.310
I wonder if I can keep up...

10:27.310 --> 10:29.060
Fel?

10:30.680 --> 10:34.980
Um, I'm not sure how I'll do either, but let's do our best.

10:34.980 --> 10:37.520
So, please cheer up. Cheer up.

10:37.520 --> 10:40.570
You're right. Our spirit is crucial to everything.

10:40.690 --> 10:42.760
You're a nice person, Bridget.

10:42.760 --> 10:43.860
I'm glad.

10:43.860 --> 10:47.580
If my roommate were mean, my academy life would be awful.

10:47.580 --> 10:48.580
Y-Yeah...

10:48.890 --> 10:51.200
Speaking of academy life, you can't ignore boys.

10:51.200 --> 10:54.390
The boy who beat Priecia is kind of cool.

10:54.390 --> 10:56.340
What do you think, Bridget?

10:56.880 --> 10:59.440
He saved you, right?

10:59.440 --> 11:00.900
His name is... let's see...

11:00.900 --> 11:02.600
It's Hyaweh. It is.

11:02.830 --> 11:04.800
You've already memorized his name?

11:04.800 --> 11:09.600
Oh, does that mean you have some romantic feelings for him?

11:09.940 --> 11:12.100
No, not at all!

11:12.510 --> 11:14.610
Hey, come on now.

11:15.020 --> 11:17.000
<i>He's a man to be reckoned with.</i>

11:15.060 --> 11:16.630
All right, I won't lose!

11:16.630 --> 11:18.610
Go, Fel!

11:17.000 --> 11:18.610
<i>I wonder what he is.</i>

11:30.890 --> 11:34.860
I shall bring an end to this duel.

11:50.470 --> 11:51.560
Ouch!

11:55.340 --> 11:57.320
The tub hurts.

12:03.410 --> 12:06.870
As I thought, school is a scary place.

12:10.240 --> 12:12.120
Is she still mad at me?

12:12.390 --> 12:14.850
Targeting, targeting...

12:14.850 --> 12:17.130
Someone is targeting you!

12:19.270 --> 12:20.190
Who are you?

12:20.190 --> 12:25.140
That aside, somebody seems to have a grudge against you, so be careful.

12:25.400 --> 12:27.890
Judging from these sly methods—

12:28.870 --> 12:32.410
Don't touch me so suddenly! Don't touch me!

12:32.810 --> 12:34.400
But these look like bicycle handles.

12:34.400 --> 12:36.370
Ring, ring. Ring, ring.

12:36.370 --> 12:40.160
Hey, they're not handles, they're ears!

12:40.160 --> 12:41.610
Sorry, sorry.

12:47.430 --> 12:48.740
That hurt.

12:48.970 --> 12:52.540
Why did the attack on you have to hurt me too?

12:52.540 --> 12:54.240
Anyway, it's time for lunch.

12:58.620 --> 13:01.120
Bridget, I assume you like potatoes?

13:01.120 --> 13:04.250
Not really. Much of the food in this country goes against my religious beliefs...

13:04.250 --> 13:08.760
No! Yeah, potatoes are my favorite. I love potatoes! Love them!

13:11.740 --> 13:15.520
Better than expec— Actually! Better than I could have imagined. Better than imagined.

13:16.100 --> 13:19.730
Well, potatoes are what girls usually like to eat.

13:19.730 --> 13:23.030
When I'm hungry, I can gobble up ten or twenty of them.

13:25.420 --> 13:26.780
Can I sit here?

13:26.780 --> 13:27.530
Rejected.

13:28.120 --> 13:29.570
Don't be like that.

13:29.570 --> 13:32.920
You can be disappointed with the outcome, but it's already over.

13:32.920 --> 13:34.330
It's over?

13:34.330 --> 13:36.250
Our duel isn't over, yet.

13:36.250 --> 13:38.880
I didn't plan on having a duel, though.

13:38.880 --> 13:40.590
You didn't plan on having a duel?

13:40.590 --> 13:42.930
Are you saying I'm no match for you?

13:42.930 --> 13:44.800
I can't forgive any more insults.

13:47.690 --> 13:49.800
What a persistent guy!

13:49.980 --> 13:52.970
He's still hanging around her after all that.

13:55.590 --> 13:58.700
He seems to want more harsh punishments, Massie.

13:58.700 --> 14:00.720
Now we'll have go with our last resort.

14:00.720 --> 14:05.740
I think this is a good chance to show our combination technique to the school.

14:05.770 --> 14:07.640
We'd be better off not trying it.

14:07.640 --> 14:08.790
We will!

14:08.790 --> 14:10.320
Y-Yes!

14:12.080 --> 14:13.580
Priecia.

14:15.020 --> 14:18.700
From now on, we're your bodyguards.

14:18.700 --> 14:20.600
We just organized this.

14:20.600 --> 14:25.840
Our mission is to protect you from all evil.

14:26.080 --> 14:30.140
One: We will keep any man who tries to approach you at bay.

14:30.470 --> 14:35.390
Two: We will try to serve you as long as we can.

14:36.480 --> 14:41.300
Three: We make sure of our allegiance to you...

14:41.300 --> 14:44.190
with our hearts beating together... once a day.

14:44.740 --> 14:48.280
Please rest assured, Priecia.

14:48.280 --> 14:52.930
We will never let that weirdo approach you again.

14:52.930 --> 14:54.670
Let me give you a bit of advice.

14:54.670 --> 14:57.550
Stay away from me from now on.

14:57.550 --> 14:59.210
Unless you want to suffer.

15:06.280 --> 15:07.720
As expected of a princess!

15:07.720 --> 15:10.080
We're just stunned by her coolness!

15:10.080 --> 15:12.520
But she is kind of scary...

15:13.070 --> 15:16.270
That is what's good about her!

15:18.120 --> 15:20.360
The A-set lunch is not enough.

15:20.360 --> 15:24.490
All right, I'm going to have a second lunch and skip my next class.

15:25.290 --> 15:27.510
I'm going to be late!

15:28.390 --> 15:29.790
That hurt.

15:30.140 --> 15:31.550
I've got to pick these up.

15:37.760 --> 15:40.180
Now I'm late.

15:44.280 --> 15:45.250
What's wrong?

15:48.150 --> 15:50.240
I won't understand if you just cry.

15:50.240 --> 15:52.760
Have you been separated from your mother?

15:53.150 --> 15:56.260
Mother? Separated?

15:56.790 --> 15:59.990
Onii-chan will help you look for her.

15:59.990 --> 16:01.960
Here. Wipe your tears.

16:04.770 --> 16:06.290
Don't worry.

16:06.290 --> 16:08.820
I'm planning on skipping my next class anyway.

16:09.560 --> 16:13.820
Is that Ms. Litte's beginner's alchemy class?

16:14.220 --> 16:15.730
You know about it?

16:15.730 --> 16:18.330
You seem to know a lot even though you're still little.

16:18.650 --> 16:20.330
I'm not little!

16:20.330 --> 16:21.620
O-Ojou-chan?

16:22.050 --> 16:24.060
I'm not an Ojou-chan!

16:24.060 --> 16:24.630
Huh?

16:25.120 --> 16:27.630
I'm a teacher!

16:31.590 --> 16:36.870
I'm Litte Ratus. I'm in charge of the Pegasus class, Hyaweh.

16:36.870 --> 16:38.640
You know me?

16:38.800 --> 16:42.390
Of course, I'm in charge of your class.

16:42.670 --> 16:43.920
Oh, that makes sense.

16:43.920 --> 16:45.600
No, that does not make sense.

16:45.600 --> 16:48.970
You said you were planning on skipping my class, didn't you?

16:48.970 --> 16:52.650
Yeah. Well, I'm so hungry.

16:52.970 --> 16:54.790
Not acceptable.

16:54.790 --> 16:57.410
You are a very bad boy.

16:57.410 --> 16:58.950
Stand in the corridor as a penalty!

17:03.070 --> 17:04.500
School is...

17:09.800 --> 17:11.660
That penalty seems to have hit him hard.

17:11.660 --> 17:13.940
One more effort and we'll be done.

17:13.940 --> 17:15.540
We better stop it.

17:15.540 --> 17:20.260
Priecia told us to stay away from her unless we want to suffer.

17:20.590 --> 17:22.800
You don't understand what she meant at all, Orichi.

17:22.800 --> 17:24.040
Yes?

17:24.040 --> 17:29.070
She was asking if we could devote our lives to protecting her.

17:29.720 --> 17:32.070
I'm sort of scared.

17:33.030 --> 17:35.850
Now that she posed the question, there's no way we can give up.

17:35.850 --> 17:40.580
We're going to prove it to Priecia that we can give our lives for her.

17:43.880 --> 17:45.080
I can't wait for it.

17:45.260 --> 17:47.970
With our sword technique that we've been practicing,

17:47.970 --> 17:50.590
we're going to break that stupid guy into pieces!

17:54.440 --> 17:56.390
S-Smash him up!

17:57.620 --> 18:01.190
I wonder if I should eat Fusha Baked Potatoes before dinner...

18:01.190 --> 18:02.100
Ouch!

18:05.420 --> 18:07.300
We will wait for you in the woods behind the academy.

18:07.300 --> 18:09.170
To lay divine punishment on an enemy of women.

18:09.170 --> 18:11.240
From the bodyguards of Priecia.

18:11.240 --> 18:12.650
What the heck is this?

18:17.870 --> 18:20.160
H-H-He's coming.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.810
Let's do as planned.

18:21.810 --> 18:23.410
Leave it to me.

18:24.180 --> 18:27.170
Huh? Nobody's here.

18:27.490 --> 18:28.370
Prepare yourself!

18:30.270 --> 18:32.460
I'm sorry!

18:36.380 --> 18:39.220
He dodged... my sword?

18:41.610 --> 18:44.970
Though I don't want to admit it, you're... no ordinary guy.

18:45.290 --> 18:48.270
Um, why are you doing this to me?

18:48.630 --> 18:50.780
You're supposed to have noticed those numerous warnings.

18:50.780 --> 18:53.120
Such as the tub, the guillotine, and the bell?

18:53.120 --> 18:54.170
That means...

18:54.170 --> 18:56.240
They're all our doing.

18:56.240 --> 18:57.940
The guillotine was mine.

18:57.940 --> 19:00.030
They're all for Priecia.

19:00.030 --> 19:01.280
Priecia?

19:01.480 --> 19:04.950
Massie, Orichi... We're doing the Maiden Hurricane Attack!

19:05.510 --> 19:06.750
Maiden Hurricane?

19:07.050 --> 19:08.290
Let's go!

19:16.530 --> 19:17.590
They're coming!

19:19.700 --> 19:21.390
Maybe it's a bad move?

19:24.730 --> 19:29.390
He just stepped on me, the second cutest girl in the school after Priecia?!

19:29.830 --> 19:32.400
I'm sorry again!

19:37.380 --> 19:38.900
Priecia!

19:39.610 --> 19:42.170
I told you before to stay away from me.

19:42.170 --> 19:43.280
But...

19:43.280 --> 19:46.410
Apparently, you can't wait to die.

19:48.720 --> 19:51.380
Stop it. They're your friends, right?

19:51.380 --> 19:53.210
I have no friends.

19:54.440 --> 19:55.860
Glow La-

20:00.580 --> 20:03.810
This way they will never come near me again.

20:03.810 --> 20:04.740
Priecia.

20:04.740 --> 20:06.540
You shouldn't get close to me, either.

20:06.540 --> 20:07.470
Why?

20:13.750 --> 20:15.590
Because this is what you will get.

20:15.590 --> 20:17.280
What a lie...

20:25.370 --> 20:28.220
Even in our castle... They just never learn.

20:28.870 --> 20:31.170
Do you know these guys?

20:31.170 --> 20:33.470
They are called ninja.

20:33.470 --> 20:36.340
Although they're weak, they're still the most annoying thing in the world.

20:36.650 --> 20:38.580
Then why are ninja here?

20:38.580 --> 20:41.050
Who knows? They never answer the question.

20:45.790 --> 20:47.580
Glow Lash!

20:56.440 --> 20:57.860
They just keep coming!

20:59.150 --> 21:00.560
I'll do it.

21:03.790 --> 21:05.800
No matter how many you bring, it'll never change!

21:05.800 --> 21:06.910
How impertinent!

21:07.390 --> 21:09.950
We're allowed to catch you by force!

21:09.950 --> 21:11.160
Get her!

21:18.440 --> 21:19.290
Who's that?!

21:26.520 --> 21:27.510
Retreat!

21:36.930 --> 21:37.660
Wha...

21:56.000 --> 22:02.230
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.610 --> 22:09.050
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:09.050 --> 22:15.840
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.840 --> 22:22.530
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.770 --> 22:29.620
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.120 --> 22:37.620
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.620 --> 22:43.550
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.550 --> 22:50.820
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.130 --> 22:57.600
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.850 --> 23:05.050
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.910
Next Episode

23:15.820 --> 23:20.830
Um, Captain Aira, aren't we, in fact, bothering her?

23:20.830 --> 23:22.740
Orichi, what are you-

23:21.400 --> 23:22.740
Indeed, we are.

23:22.740 --> 23:25.650
But who else would protect Priecia?

23:25.650 --> 23:26.780
No, nobody else.

23:26.780 --> 23:27.120
Full stop!

23:27.120 --> 23:30.300
But that mysterious Miko always seems
to be hanging around her.

23:31.100 --> 23:33.490
Next episode, "The Knights' Pride".

23:33.490 --> 23:35.770
Shine, my feelings toward Hyaweh.

23:34.640 --> 23:39.020
The Knights' Pride

23:35.770 --> 23:36.890
Orichi!
